        freebies for other CNet SysOps.  As long as you're a registered
        CNet owner, I don't care what you do with them.  If you make them
        better, great - let me see it...  If you learn from them, super -
        release your own stuff...  However, I request that none of these
        be modified and released publically without my approval.  If I
        see this happen (it has in the past), I just won't bother giving
        out anything anymore.  No one's forcing me to do it!  I love it!
        So, keep me happy and coding...  ;)

